<title>USA: American Brands Inc Q4 results.</title>
<headline>American Brands Inc Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr oper		 $  1.01		   $ 0.92</p>
<p> Shr net		     0.67		     0.85</p>
<p> Net			114,000		  154,100</p>
<p> Revs		   3,435,300		3,084,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     170,300		  180,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     174,400		  187,300</p>
<p>	 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr oper		  $ 3.20		   $ 2.88</p>
<p> Shr net		     2.74		     2.83</p>
<p> Net			486,500		  540,400</p>
<p> Revs		  11,579,300	     11,367,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     173,300		  186,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     178,400		  195,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter figures exclude restructuring charges of $0.34 per share ($0.33 fully diluted) in 1996 related to a plant consolidation in international tobacco, $0.06 per share in 1995 in connection with the worldwide reorganization of distilled spirits operations, and a $0.01 per share in 1995 from operations of businesses disposed of.</p>
<p>The 1996 restructuring charge amounted to $88.8 million ($59.5 million after taxes), and the 1995 charge amounted to $17.8 million ($12.2 million after taxes). The comparisons reflect the benefit of share repurchases.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
